      "content": "omg i just read online that st johns wort can actually make birth control not work and i'm freaking out because i've already started taking it... i really don't want to get pregnant right now. is there like a way i can just take an extra pill or a higher dose of my birth control to make sure it stays effective while i'm on the herb? i really need a way to make this work without stopping everything.",
